 "words": 179,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "From Gilgal down to Bethel, from Bethel down to the river",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The old prophet and his servant walked the road together",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stay here, the old man told him, but Elisha would not stay",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As the LORD lives, I will not leave you, I will walk with you today",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At the Jordan Elijah rolled his cloak and struck the water",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It parted left and right, they crossed on the dry ground",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ask what I may do for you before I am taken from you",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let me receive a double portion of your spirit",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Suddenly a chariot of fire and horses of fire appeared",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Elijah went up to heaven in a whirlwind",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My father, my father",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The chariots and horsemen of Israel",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he saw him no more",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He picked up the cloak that had fallen",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He struck the river as the old man had",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the water parted for him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Suddenly a chariot of fire and horses of fire appeared",
